name: composition
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a composed surface — a scope built from other scopes, a module
      folded into a registry — silently minted the wrong thing: present
      in name, empty in content. The defect is in how parts join, not
      in any member's semantics. Distinct from bug-fix: the members each
      worked; only the join lied.
